  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">RE-Start Campaign 2</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall goal of Oxfam Pilipinas&apos;s just energy transition programme is to support partners and stakeholders&apos; campaign for stronger government commitment to policy and regulatory changes for accessible and affordable renewable energy systems and schemes in the Philippines. The just energy transition asserts people and communities participation to build ownership in identifying, accessing and implementing renewable energy initiatives from national to local levels, to increase access of climate vulnerable and energy poor communities to reliable and affordable renewable energy schemes in the Philippines  - towards democratized energy systems which ensure ecological integrity.</narrative>
  </description>
